  "pages": [
    {
      "sort": 100000,
      "name": "Welcome to Bad Eden",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "yUngKTTItFaWgqxc",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1689\">Reality broke.</p><p data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1727\">Not metaphorically. Not spiritually.</p><p data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1739\">Literally.</p><p data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1919\">Once, the world existed as part of a vast structure called <strong data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1815\">Adam Kadmon</strong>—a cosmic architecture that bound imagination, matter, and meaning together into a single living system.</p><p data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1939\">Then it collapsed.</p><p data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"2074\">Fragments of that structure now drift across existence as <strong data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2032\">hex-shaped regions of reality</strong>, each holding pieces of the broken whole.</p><p data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2108\">You live inside those fragments.</p><p data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2165\">And you are among the few who understand what happened.</p><img src=\"art/bbttcc/GOTTGAIT/BBTTCC_Character_Options/Feats/bbttcc_feats_backline_commander.png\">"
      },
      "video": {
        "controls": true,
        "volume": 0.5
      },
