    {
      "sort": 200000,
      "name": "What this Game Is",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "sBptvrC6J1ixJndw",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2270\">Bad Eden is a faction-driven tabletop RPG about <strong data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2269\">repairing a broken world</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2293\">Players control both:</p><p data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2373\">• <strong data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2311\">Characters</strong> exploring the world<br data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2334\">• <strong data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2349\">A faction</strong> rebuilding civilization</p><p data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2393\">Together you will:</p><p data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2532\">• explore mysterious hexes<br data-start=\"2421\" data-end=\"2424\">• solve strange problems<br data-start=\"2448\" data-end=\"2451\">• develop territory<br data-start=\"2470\" data-end=\"2473\">• defend your faction<br data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2497\">• slowly restore harmony to reality</p><p data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2595\">Every action pushes the world toward <strong data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2595\">repair… or collapse.</strong></p><img src=\"art/bbttcc/GOTTGAIT/BBTTCC_Character_Options/Feats/bbttcc_feats_adaptive_defense.png\">"
      },
      "video": {
        "controls": true,
        "volume": 0.5
      },
      "src": null,
      "category": null,
      "ownership": {
        "default": -1,
