    {
      "sort": 300000,
      "name": "What Players Actually Do",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "YpgIfZWO5EmflrXY",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>During play, your faction is trying to <strong data-start=\"2673\" data-end=\"2701\">repair pieces of reality</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"2704\" data-end=\"2736\">Each session you will typically:</p><ol data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2972\"><li data-section-id=\"6rdpoc\" data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2762\"><p data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2762\"><strong data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2762\">Explore new hexes</strong></p></li><li data-section-id=\"8898k8\" data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2801\"><p data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2801\"><strong data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2801\">Encounter problems or mysteries</strong></p></li><li data-section-id=\"9eqrm0\" data-start=\"2802\" data-end=\"2847\"><p data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2847\"><strong data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2847\">Make decisions about how to solve them</strong></p></li><li data-section-id=\"19e92u6\" data-start=\"2848\" data-end=\"2900\"><p data-start=\"2851\" data-end=\"2900\"><strong data-start=\"2851\" data-end=\"2900\">Resolve conflicts (raids or skill challenges)</strong></p></li><li data-section-id=\"1tf5s2f\" data-start=\"2901\" data-end=\"2925\"><p data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"2925\"><strong data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"2925\">Develop territory</strong></p></li><li data-section-id=\"1tczxne\" data-start=\"2926\" data-end=\"2972\"><p data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"2972\"><strong data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"2972\">Advance the world toward the Great Work</strong></p></li></ol><p data-start=\"2974\" data-end=\"2993\">Your choices shape:</p><p data-start=\"2995\" data-end=\"3056\">• the world<br data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3009\">• your faction<br data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3026\">• the future of reality itself</p><img src=\"art/bbttcc/GOTTGAIT/BBTTCC_Character_Options/Feats/bbttcc_feats_focused_shot.png\">"
      },
      "video": {
