    {
      "sort": 400000,
      "name": "The Gameplay Loop",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "u2HcnCkuFm6aeiVT",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>Almost everything in Bad Eden follows this cycle.</p><pre class=\"overflow-visible! px-0!\" data-start=\"3157\" data-end=\"3328\"><code>EXPLORE HEX\n     ↓\nDISCOVER A PROBLEM\n     ↓\nTRIGGER A CAMPAIGN BEAT\n     ↓\nMAKE DECISIONS\n     ↓\nRESOLVE CONFLICT\n     ↓\nDEVELOP TERRITORY\n     ↓\nADVANCE THE TURN</code></pre><p data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3354\">Over time this leads to:</p><p data-start=\"3356\" data-end=\"3437\">• stronger factions<br data-start=\"3375\" data-end=\"3378\">• repaired territory<br data-start=\"3398\" data-end=\"3401\">• progress toward the <strong data-start=\"3423\" data-end=\"3437\">Great Work</strong></p><p data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3459\">Or… deeper collapse.</p><img src=\"art/bbttcc/GOTTGAIT/BBTTCC_Character_Options/Feats/bbttcc_feats_breach_specialist.png\">"
      },
      "video": {
        "controls": true,
        "volume": 0.5
      },
      "src": null,
      "category": null,
      "ownership": {
        "default": -1,
        "vmUfDuSYUIe7V5uB": 3
      },
      "flags": {},
      "_stats": {
        "compendiumSource": null,
        "duplicateSource": null,
        "exportSource": null,
        "coreVersion": "14.363",
