    {
      "sort": 500000,
      "name": "Your First Session",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "vQTFtVz2pLy5hPRk",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p data-start=\"3492\" data-end=\"3532\">A typical first session looks like this:</p><h3 data-section-id=\"1r8mk6l\" data-start=\"3534\" data-end=\"3559\">1 — Create Characters</h3><p data-start=\"3560\" data-end=\"3611\">Players build characters and join a shared faction.</p><h3 data-section-id=\"f16y4e\" data-start=\"3613\" data-end=\"3642\">2 — Establish the Faction</h3><p data-start=\"3643\" data-end=\"3707\">The faction begins with a small territory and limited resources.</p><h3 data-section-id=\"sn6lzo\" data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"3741\">3 — Explore the Starting Hex</h3><p data-start=\"3742\" data-end=\"3807\">The first exploration reveals the <strong data-start=\"3776\" data-end=\"3806\">first problem in the world</strong>.</p><h3 data-section-id=\"1f59cbs\" data-start=\"3809\" data-end=\"3841\">4 — Encounter the First Beat</h3><p data-start=\"3842\" data-end=\"3889\">A narrative situation requiring player choices.</p><h3 data-section-id=\"o1r0bo\" data-start=\"3891\" data-end=\"3917\">5 — Resolve a Conflict</h3><p data-start=\"3918\" data-end=\"3996\">This might involve a <strong data-start=\"3939\" data-end=\"3947\">raid</strong>, skill checks, diplomacy, or creative solutions.</p><h3 data-section-id=\"1tt11e7\" data-start=\"3998\" data-end=\"4027\">6 — Improve the Territory</h3><p data-start=\"4028\" data-end=\"4092\">Success allows the faction to develop the hex or gain resources.</p><h3 data-section-id=\"1hxejqz\" data-start=\"4094\" data-end=\"4118\">7 — Advance the Turn</h3><p data-start=\"4119\" data-end=\"4165\">The world reacts and new opportunities appear.</p><p data-start=\"4167\" data-end=\"4194\">And the cycle begins again.</p><hr data-start=\"4196\" data-end=\"4199\"><h3>Sample Gameplay Loop in Action</h3><p data-start=\"4239\" data-end=\"4255\">Example session:</p><pre class=\"overflow-visible! px-0!\" data-start=\"4257\" data-end=\"4533\"><code>Players explore an abandoned hex\n↓\nThey discover corrupted infrastructure\n↓\nA Campaign Beat triggers\n↓\nPlayers investigate the cause\n↓\nThey raid a hostile entity controlling the hex\n↓\nVictory restores part of the region\n↓\nFaction develops the territory\n↓\nTurn advances</code></pre><p data-start=\"4535\" data-end=\"4586\">Each success pushes the world closer to <strong data-start=\"4575\" data-end=\"4585\">repair</strong>.</p><img src=\"art/bbttcc/GOTTGAIT/BBTTCC_Character_Options/Feats/bbttcc_feats_grave_calm.jpeg\">"
      },
